%% frame: UC2 B9, A3 to A5: current user, sign out, and later requests (design)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer
    participant SI as :SaInterceptor
    participant AC as :AuthController
    participant AL as :AdminListingController
    participant SU as :StpUtil
    participant UA as :UserAppService
    participant SSI as :SessionStpInterface
    participant DAO as :SaTokenDao

    Note over Buyer,UA: B9 (identity-svc): the callback page reads the current user
    Buyer->>AC: me()
    AC->>SU: getLoginIdAsString()
    SU-->>AC: userId
    AC->>UA: currentUser(userId)
    UA-->>AC: CurrentUser
    AC->>SU: getRoleList()
    SU-->>AC: roles; in identity-svc StpInterfaceImpl reads the database
    AC-->>Buyer: 200 Result(MeResponse)
    Note over Buyer,SU: A3: sign out
    Buyer->>AC: logout()
    AC->>SU: logout()
    AC-->>Buyer: 200; only this browser's token ends
    Note over Buyer,SU: A4: a protected /api/v1 path without a session
    Buyer->>SI: preHandle(request, response, handler)
    SI->>SU: checkLogin()
    SU-->>SI: NotLoginException
    SI-->>Buyer: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED (COMMON_401_001)
    Note over Buyer,DAO: A5 (commerce-svc): an admin operation, here the UC9 counts
    Buyer->>AL: counts()
    AL->>AL: administrator()
    AL->>SU: checkRole("admin")
    SU->>SSI: getRoleList(loginId, loginType)
    SSI->>DAO: getSession(sessionId)
    DAO-->>SSI: SaSession with the snapshot of B8
    SSI-->>SU: roles; empty if missing or malformed
    break role missing
        SU-->>AL: NotRoleException
        AL-->>Buyer: 403 FORBIDDEN (COMMON_403_001)
    end
    AL-->>Buyer: 200; checkPermission follows the same path
